+- Label image: $\mathbf{L} \in \mathbb{Z}^{H \times W}$ (uint8).
+- Index map: $\mathbf{I} \in \mathbb{Z}^{H \times W}$ (int32), storing the source point index for each pixel (or -1 if empty).
 
 **Data Structures:**
-- KDTree built from `xyz` for nearest-neighbour queries.
-- 3D covariance matrix `cov3d` $[N, 3, 3]$ per point.
-- 2D conic matrix, radius, and tile information per visible point.
